        "text": "It does remind me of this snippet from the Inform 7 literate programming docs (<https://ganelson.github.io/inweb/inweb/M-iti.html>) though:\n\n> ... LP is not much practiced, but it is also because, as Christopher Wyk perceptively observed (CACM 33.3, 1990), \"no one has yet volunteered to write a program using another's system for literate programming\". ",
